      "id": "claim_96f6659d6f8a4820a7869763500e9f3a",
      "statement": "FilesystemMiddleware evicts a large tool result by writing its text to `{large_tool_results_prefix}/{sanitized_tool_call_id}` on the backend and replacing the ToolMessage with a TOO_LARGE_TOOL_MSG head+tail preview that instructs recovery via read_file with offset/limit; if the backend write fails the original message is kept.",
